= Machine learning — Simple =

'''Machine learning''' is a way of building computer systems that learn patterns or behavior from data.

Instead of writing every rule by hand, we give a learning method examples, feedback, or experience.

The system then builds a model that can make predictions or decisions.

Machine learning is part of artificial intelligence, but it is not the whole of AI.

A good machine-learning system should work on new data, not only the examples it saw while training.

